      <h1>Zanzibar Marine Park Fees 2025: Complete Guide</h1>
      <p class="blog-excerpt">Complete guide to Zanzibar marine park fees for 2025. Mnemba, Menai Bay, Chumbe, Jozani, and all conservation fees. What's included, how to pay, and which tours include fees.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="blog-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Why Marine Park Fees Exist</h2>
        <p>Zanzibar's marine parks protect some of the world's most biodiverse coral reefs, turtle nesting sites, and dolphin habitats. Fees fund:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Ranger patrols & anti-poaching</li>
          <li>Coral reef monitoring & restoration</li>
          <li>Turtle nesting protection & hatcheries</li>
          <li>Community development (schools, clinics, water projects)</li>
          <li>Education & awareness programs</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Your fee directly protects the reefs and wildlife you came to see.</strong></p>
      </section>

      <section>
